## Data Flow

### Tick ingestion flow

```
AngelOne WebSocket (SmartAPI WS 2.0 binary protocol)
  → BinaryDecoder (Phase 2C) — paise → rupees, IST timestamp
  → Normalizer (Phase 2C) — canonical ticker, crossed-spread guard
  → TickEvent on EventBus
  → CandleAggregator — rolls ticks into 1m candles
  → ticks table (TimescaleDB hypertable, async batch insert)
  → candles table (continuous aggregate from ticks + REST backfill)
```

### Signal-to-execution flow

```
BarEvent (from candles) → SignalEngine → signals table
  → RiskValidationPipeline (6 stages)
  → orders table (placed)
  → AngelOne REST API (live) / OrderSimulator (backtest/paper)
  → executions table (fill confirmed)
  → trades table (status updated)
  → positions table (MTM updated)
  → equity_curve table (bar-close point)
  → learning_records table (on trade close)
```

### Learning data flow

```
trades.status = 'closed'
  → learning_records written (atomic, same transaction)
  → pg_cron EOD 18:30 IST
      → strategy_performance (GROUP BY strategy_run_id, regime)
      → indicator_performance (unpack features_at_entry JSONB)
      → regime_performance (GROUP BY regime, timeframe, symbol_id)
  → signal engine reads regime_fitness + indicator_rankings
  → next signal fires with recalibrated weights
```

