### `ticks`

TimescaleDB hypertable. Partitioned by `exchange_ts`, 1-day chunks.

| Field | Type | Constraints | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `tick_id` | `uuid` NOT NULL | | Not surrogate PK — partition PK is `(symbol_id, exchange_ts)` |
| `symbol_id` | `uuid` NOT NULL | FK → `symbols` (NOT VALID) | FK validated nightly, not at insert |
| `exchange_ts` | `timestamptz` NOT NULL | Partition key | Unix ms from exchange, stored UTC |
| `received_ts` | `timestamptz` NOT NULL | DEFAULT `now()` | Adapter wall-clock write time |
| `price` | `numeric(12,2)` NOT NULL | | LTP in rupees |
| `volume` | `bigint` NOT NULL | | Cumulative day volume at this tick |
| `bid` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | NULL if crossed or absent |
| `ask` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | NULL if crossed or absent |
| `open_price` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | Day open at tick time |
| `high_price` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | Day high at tick time |
| `low_price` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | Day low at tick time |
| `avg_traded_price` | `numeric(12,2)` | nullable | VWAP proxy from exchange |
| `total_buy_qty` | `bigint` | nullable | Aggregate buy-side quantity |
| `total_sell_qty` | `bigint` | nullable | Aggregate sell-side quantity |
| `session_id` | `varchar(36)` | | WS session that wrote this tick |

**Constraints:** `CHECK (bid IS NULL OR ask IS NULL OR bid < ask)` — crossed spread rejected at DB level.

**TimescaleDB policies:** compress after 7 days (`segmentby symbol_id`, `orderby exchange_ts`); drop after 90 days.

**Write optimisations:** `synchronous_commit = off` for tick writer connection only (ticks are reconstructible); FK declared `NOT VALID`, validated nightly; batch insert via COPY protocol.

