## Indexing Strategy (Phase 3F)

### Hot path indexes (sub-millisecond, market hours)

```sql
-- Active position lookup (fires on every tick for subscribed symbols)
CREATE INDEX idx_positions_active
  ON positions (symbol_id, portfolio_id)
  WHERE status IN ('open', 'partial');

-- Open order monitor (broker reconciliation loop ~500ms)
CREATE INDEX idx_orders_open
  ON orders (trade_id, placed_at)
  WHERE status IN ('pending','placed','open','partial');

-- Live trade lookup by account (position manager hot path)
CREATE INDEX idx_trades_live
  ON trades (account_id, status, opened_at DESC)
  WHERE status IN ('open','partial') AND mode = 'live';

-- Signal engine: pending signals for expiry sweep
CREATE INDEX idx_signals_pending
  ON signals (expires_at)
  WHERE status = 'pending';

-- Broker order reconciliation
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_orders_broker_id
  ON orders (broker_order_id)
  WHERE broker_order_id IS NOT NULL;

-- Execution dedup guard (fires on every fill)
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_executions_broker_fill
  ON executions (broker_fill_id);
```

### Analytical path indexes (seconds acceptable, off-market hours)

```sql
-- Candle range scan — primary backtest access pattern
-- COVERING INDEX: no heap fetch needed
CREATE INDEX idx_candles_backtest
  ON candles (symbol_id, timeframe, bucket_ts DESC)
  INCLUDE (open, high, low, close, volume);

-- Tick range for CandleAggregator replay
CREATE INDEX idx_ticks_replay
  ON ticks (symbol_id, exchange_ts DESC)
  INCLUDE (price, volume, bid, ask);

-- Trade P&L aggregation by strategy run
CREATE INDEX idx_trades_strategy
  ON trades (account_id, mode, opened_at DESC)
  INCLUDE (realised_pnl, commission, slippage);

-- Learning records by regime (model training scan)
CREATE INDEX idx_learning_regime
  ON learning_records (regime, trade_closed_at DESC)
  INCLUDE (was_winner, actual_return, predicted_return, kelly_used);

-- Option chain latest snapshot
CREATE INDEX idx_option_chain_latest
  ON option_chain_snapshots (underlying_id, expiry, captured_at DESC);
```

### Write path (high-throughput inserts)

`ticks` and `equity_curve`: TimescaleDB creates chunk-local indexes automatically on the partition key. No additional global indexes — doubles WAL write amplification without benefit.

`executions`: append-only; `broker_fill_id` unique index is the only index needed beyond the trade FK.

```sql
CREATE INDEX idx_executions_trade
  ON executions (trade_id, exchange_ts);
```

### Index maintenance

`REINDEX CONCURRENTLY` weekly (Sunday 03:00 IST via `pg_cron`) on all partial indexes. Monthly review of `pg_stat_user_indexes`: any index with `idx_scan = 0` after 30 trading days is dropped. GIN indexes on JSONB columns deferred to Phase 5 — only added if learning engine JSONB path queries measure > 50ms.

