## Backup & Recovery Strategy (Phase 3F)

### Continuous WAL archiving

WAL segments streamed to S3-compatible object storage in real time. Recovery point objective (RPO): < 5 minutes. All write connections use `synchronous_commit = on` except tick writer.

### Daily base backups

`pg_basebackup` runs daily at 02:00 IST. Retained 30 days on object storage. TimescaleDB chunks older than compression threshold are already compressed — backup is storage-efficient.

### Recovery tiers

| Scenario | Recovery method | RTO |
|---|---|---|
| Single row corruption (trades) | Point-in-time recovery (PITR) + audit log replay | < 1 hour |
| Table-level corruption | PITR to last known-good point | < 2 hours |
| Full instance failure | Promote standby replica | < 5 minutes |
| Tick data loss | Reconstruct from broker WebSocket on reconnect | < 1 trading session |

### Read replica

Synchronous streaming replication to one read replica. Replica serves: all backtest and analytical queries, report generation, learning engine aggregation. Live trading writer never sees analytical load.

---

## Archival Strategy (Phase 3F)

### Cold storage pattern

Detached `positions` partitions (closed, older than 1 year) move to `positions_archive` table via `pg_partman` partition detach + `ATTACH TABLE`. Archive table is identical in schema but on a cheaper tablespace. Application queries `positions` for hot data; archive queries target `positions_archive`. No application code change — tablespace swap only.

### Retention summary

| Table | Hot retention | Archive / cold |
|---|---|---|
| `accounts` | Permanent | No expiry (soft-delete) |
| `portfolios` | Permanent | NAV history kept |
| `positions` (open) | Until closed | — |
| `positions` (closed) | 1 year hot | Detach → archive tablespace |
| `trades` | Permanent | Never drop |
| `equity_curve` (1m) | 90 days | Drop after |
| `equity_curve` (1h agg) | 3 years | Compress at 30 days |
| `equity_curve` (1d agg) | Permanent | Never drop |
| `performance_metrics` | Permanent | Tiny row count |
| `learning_records` | Permanent | Source of truth for model training |

### `pg_cron` scheduled jobs

| Job | Schedule | Action |
|---|---|---|
| EOD metrics recompute | 18:30 IST daily | Recompute `performance_metrics` for active portfolios |
| Equity curve aggregate | Hourly | Refresh `equity_curve_1h` continuous aggregate |
| Partition maintenance | Sunday 02:00 IST | Detach `positions` partitions older than 1 year |
| Tick FK validation | 01:00 IST daily | `VALIDATE CONSTRAINT` on `ticks.symbol_id` FK |
| Index maintenance | Sunday 03:00 IST | `REINDEX CONCURRENTLY` on partial indexes |
| Session state purge | 09:00 IST daily | Truncate `broker_sessions` and `active_subscriptions` (unlogged tables rebuilt on connect) |
| Instrument master sync | 20:00 IST daily | Upsert symbols from SmartAPI master JSON |

