## Final Approved Phase 3 Design

### Migration sequence

```
001_extensions.sql         — timescaledb, pg_partman, pg_cron, uuid-ossp, pgcrypto
002_enums.sql              — exchange_t, asset_type, timeframe_t, signal_st, trade_st, order_st, position_st, candle_st
003_accounts_sessions.sql  — accounts, broker_sessions (unlogged), active_subscriptions (unlogged)
004_symbols.sql            — symbols
005_market_data.sql        — ticks (hypertable), candles (hypertable), option_chain_snapshots, option_strikes
006_strategy_runs.sql      — strategy_runs (M1 gap fill)
007_signals_trades.sql     — signals, trades
008_orders_executions.sql  — orders, executions
009_portfolio.sql          — portfolios, positions, equity_curve (hypertable), performance_metrics
010_learning.sql           — learning_records, strategy_performance, indicator_performance, regime_performance
011_risk_limits.sql        — risk_limits (M4 gap fill)
012_audit_log.sql          — audit_log, key_versions (M5 gap fill)
013_sync_log.sql           — sync_log (M3 gap fill)
014_indexes.sql            — all hot-path, analytical, and write-path indexes
015_partitions.sql         — pg_partman config, TimescaleDB retention/compression policies
016_close_reason.sql       — ALTER TABLE trades ADD COLUMN close_reason varchar(30) [Phase 4H Correction 1]
017_strategy_runs_reports.sql — ALTER TABLE strategy_runs ADD COLUMN reports_jsonb jsonb [Phase 4H Correction 2]
018_rbac.sql               — CREATE ROLE artha_writer, artha_reader, artha_admin; GRANT/REVOKE
019_cron_jobs.sql          — pg_cron job registrations
```

### Continuous aggregates

```
database/timescaledb/continuous_aggregates.sql
  ticks_1m              — rollup from ticks
  candles_5m            — rollup from candles (1m)
  candles_15m           — rollup from candles (5m)
  candles_1h            — rollup from candles (15m)
  candles_1d            — rollup from candles (1h)
  equity_curve_1h       — OHLC equity rollup from equity_curve (1m)
  equity_curve_1d       — daily close equity from equity_curve (1h)
```

